## Summary
- Write down decisions.

@lesson flutter-m20-l08 | Desktop and web deployment | 8
## Learning objectives
- Ship to more platforms

## Desktop and web deployment
Build with `flutter build web`, `flutter build windows/macos/linux`. Adapt input (mouse, keyboard), window sizes and platform conventions.

```dart
// flutter build web --release
void main() {}
```

## Summary
- Adapt UX per platform.

@lesson flutter-m20-l09 | Advanced testing | 8
## Learning objectives
- Test like a professional team

## Advanced testing
Use golden tests for visuals, contract tests for APIs, test coverage reports and device farms (Firebase Test Lab) for integration tests.

```dart
// flutter test --coverage
// matchesGoldenFile('goldens/home.png')
void main() {}
```

## Summary
- Combine test types for confidence.

